Hello folks,

Now you can help Willy to catch the leprechaun and find the gold in the end of the rainbow. ːsteamhappyː

What is new:
- Player movement now is controlled by 2 buttons (left/right or a/d or horizontal axis in gamepad);
- Willy movement animation is smoother;
- Restart level is much faster;
- Loading is really really fast too;
- Some bugs fixed;

We are so excited with this update and hope you can enjoy it too.
Tell us what you think about this new version.

Best,
Colossus Game Studio team.

Hey guys!

A new update is available for download (v1.0.4).
In this update the game is running more smooth and some bugs is fixed.

- LOD implemented in all the itens of the gameplay;
- Bug in the 27 level was fixed;
- Bug in clouds of the level 41 was fixed;

We are working to improve more features in the gameplay. Stay tuned for more news ;)

Hello everyone!

In version 1.0.3 we refine some levels trying to improve the performance so that the game runs as smooth as possible.

What is new?


    Reduced the number of clouds in the game;
    Reduced elements that is not showing all the time;
    Fixes some little bugs;


Stay tuned for more news about Rainbow Hunter game.

Thanks!
